       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\nIbuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum of 3,200 mg/day for adults in a monitored setting. A single 1600 mg dose is also double the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose. At this level the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up a lot.\n\nYou may have meant one of these:\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the usual maximum)\n- **600 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **400 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into smaller doses\n\nTell me which dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and I'll enter it with a note recording your confirmation."
